<view class="page history-page">
  <view class="page-title">之前的报销，都在这里。</view>
  <view class="muted">按创建时间整理，打开后可继续编辑。</view>
  <view class="history-records">
  <view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="empty section">还没有记录。返回首页，新建一次报销。</view>
  <block wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id">
    <view wx:if="{{item.showDay}}" class="date-heading">{{item.day}}</view>
    <button class="history-item" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open" hover-class="button-pressed">
      <image class="history-icon" src="/assets/icons/file-text.svg" aria-hidden="true" />
      <view class="history-copy">
        <view class="history-title">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="muted">{{item.detail}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="history-time">{{item.time}}</view>
      <image class="history-arrow" src="/assets/icons/chevron-right.svg" aria-hidden="true" />
    </button>
  </block>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{unreadable}}" class="error">有 {{unreadable}} 条记录暂时无法读取，原材料已保留。请保留应用数据以便恢复。</view>
  <view class="note history-note">记录保存在这台手机。清理小程序数据或换机可能影响历史记录，请及时导出需要的文件。</view>
</view>
